{"product_id":"vaporesso-nexus-nx-replacement-coil-5-pack","title":"Vaporesso Nexus NX Replacement Coil (5-Pack)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Vaporesso Nexus Replacement Coils is specially designed for the Nexus AIO Kit, featuring the NX CCELL Coil with ceramic technology as well as a traditional cotton of the NX Coil. The utilization of ceramic heating elements delivers tremendous aroma of flavors, with reduction in spit-back and dry hit for longer longevity. Each package comes in a pack of five replacement coils.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVaporesso Nexus Replacement Coil Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.0ohm NX Coil - rated for 7-12W (Traditional Cotton)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOrganic Cotton\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStainless Steel Structure\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41990944948279,"sku":"V Nexus NX Replace Coil (5-Pack)","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_nexus_nx_replacement_coils.jpg?v=1763426267","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-nexus-nx-replacement-coil-5-pack","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




